# License status

The licensing terms for the paper-specific code in this repository are currently under institutional review.

Until an explicit software licence is approved and added to this repository, no licence is granted for reuse, modification, redistribution, sublicensing, or incorporation of the code into other software beyond permissions that may otherwise apply by law. The repository is publicly accessible to support scientific peer review and transparency.

If an open-source licence is approved, this file will be replaced with the complete text of that licence before the Nature Research software checklist is returned and/or before publication.

External software, packages, and workflows referenced or linked from this repository remain subject to their own respective licences.

For questions about reuse before the licensing review is complete, please contact the repository maintainers.
